# Windsurf Cascade Rules: Anti-Slop Design

Trigger this workflow whenever generating or refactoring UI components or styling:
- Follow `SKILL.md` rules.
- Strictly eliminate AI slop: no purple dark mode radial gradients, no duplicate KPIs, no raw emojis in buttons.
- Follow the 1-to-3 UX rule and 85% statistical prioritization.
- Implement 8-state interactive feedback with tactile active press (`scale(0.97)`).
- Complete the 7-Axis Quality Gate before declaring completion.
